  "overview": {
    "title": "Sand, tea and stars",
    "p1": "From Zagora you can arrange camel treks and nights in desert camps — the experience many travellers come south for. Options range from a short sunset ride to a full overnight with dinner and sunrise.",
    "p2": "Quality varies: ask what is included, how far the camp sits from town, and whether toilets and bedding match your expectations. Winter nights are cold; summer days are extreme.",
    "p3": "Book through a trusted hotel or operator, agree the price in advance, and treat the desert with the respect heat and isolation demand."
